						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														Plane of Hate, Saturday January 26th.  All 46+ are welcome to come.  <br />
Goals of the raid.  <br />
Sumeni needs vampire blood off a forsaken revanant for epic quest.<br />
Tgressus needs a Drop off of Maestro of Rancor,  ( Forgot Drop Name,  some kind of hand or something )<br />
Also drops <br />
Basoon Haste Gauntlets <br />
Evensong <br />
Kelin's Seven Stringed Lute <br />
Shield of the Stalwart Seas <br />
 <br />
Shadobane,  if he goes,  needs rogue epic book,  if he doesnt attend,  another rogue will recieve.  <br />
and of course  phat lewts for everyone else =). <br />
All other drops will be lottoed if you will wear.  Plane of Hate is considered the easiest of the planes,  therefore the least desireable of all the planar gear,   but pimp gear all the same.<br />
<br />
I will purchase the stones needed to port up.  Please assemble in sro around 10am pst, 12pm cst and hope to leave 30mins later.  I will purchase 8 stones in hopes that we will have at least 6 groups worth of peeps that that want to go.  <br />
<br />
Who drops what?<br />
Because I am lazy,  look it up yourself =P  http://eqbeastiary.allakhazam.com/search.shtml?zone=68<br />
<br />
Please try to be there on time,  if you are late and we port up,  there is no way to come down and get you as each group that goes up is going to cost 105pp.  <br />
<br />
Also,  Please be sure to invite Dark Empire as I dont have any contact within.  The more peeps the better,  fun time =)  <br />
<br />
First group up is more or less the suicide group,  Everyone that goes up should make there way Invis to SE corner,  and if you gain aggro,  you get your loc and dont run,  let the mob rape you and we will have a rogue CR you instead of training the camp and ruining the whole raid.  <br />
<br />
Please be sure you have level 46 secured as you cannot lose level and be rezzed in if you are 45.  <br />
<br />
Think thats it =)  <br />
<br />
As a backup plan,  if we dont have enough to do Plane of Hate,  I am thinking either a Reaver Raid in CoM or maybe a Kael Raid ?  Hopefully we can get enough peeps to come support us in hate as we tackle some epic mobs and get some phat lewts =))<br />
<br />
Oh ya,  because peeps have shown interest in Gnome invasion on CB,  afterwards,  we could make gnomes,  get drunk and race around gfay and cb to celebrate a successful raid =D						</td>
